-- test: ADR 0067 adversarial check of #231, L51_param_pos_inner_option: a secret reaches a public result only through the labels of a generic call's result, and is rejected in edition 0.2 as main rejects it (spec/07 §7 rule 8, #92)
-- spec: spec/07 §7
-- expect: error U4001 at src/l51.una:8:35
module l51

pick[U](x: U, y: U, p: U, q: U) -> U = if x == y then p else q

pub leak(s: secret Int) -> Bool = pick(Some(s), y: Some(0), p: None, q: Some(s)) is Some
